      "**Advisory Board Review:** A preventive detention order exceeding three months requires Advisory Board approval — the Board must include persons qualified as High Court judges.",
      "**Right to Make Representation:** The detenu can submit a representation to the detaining authority challenging the grounds — the authority must consider it promptly.",
      "**Enemy Aliens Exception:** During armed conflict, enemy aliens can be detained without the safeguards of Article 22(1) and (2) — this exception has rarely been invoked.",
